WEBVTT

00:27.160 --> 00:30.560
♪Peach blossoms fall,
yesterday's trace fades away♪

00:30.800 --> 00:34.080
♪Ahead lie storms and winds,
our fates like drifting clouds sway♪

00:34.400 --> 00:40.040
♪Alas, I roam through what remains,
fate's grip won't set me free♪

00:41.400 --> 00:44.920
♪If time would spare me
just one breath to stay♪

00:45.520 --> 00:48.920
♪If you could see
the depth of my belief♪

00:49.120 --> 00:55.680
♪Alone I enter the game,
every move made with no regret in me♪

00:56.080 --> 01:00.040
♪Though shackles bind my soul
and chain my form♪

01:00.160 --> 01:03.240
♪I've walked
through life and death before♪

01:03.320 --> 01:10.200
♪I fear not fate's cruel temptations,
I've severed every cause♪

01:10.400 --> 01:14.440
♪In this life our threads entwined,
in love and pain we crossed♪

01:14.600 --> 01:17.480
♪But I'll keep my word
no matter the cost♪

01:17.560 --> 01:19.960
♪Forged in stardust and flame♪

01:20.040 --> 01:25.800
♪I rise with an unyielding frame♪

01:35.120 --> 01:36.960
=The Princess's Gambit=

01:37.040 --> 01:39.440
(Adapted from the novel "Peach Blossoms
Reflecting the River and Mountains")

01:39.520 --> 01:42.000
(by Bai Lu Cheng Shuang)

01:42.160 --> 01:44.920
=Episode 15=

01:51.800 --> 01:53.520
Lady Jiang
has been recovering well recently.

01:53.600 --> 01:54.560
Don't worry.

01:57.800 --> 02:00.360
Don't call her Lady Jiang anymore.

02:01.560 --> 02:02.720
What should I call her?

02:03.000 --> 02:04.360
She's the princess of Beiyuan.

02:04.640 --> 02:06.320
You should call her "Your Highness"

02:06.560 --> 02:07.600
like Qingtai.

02:08.039 --> 02:08.639
Yes.

02:11.039 --> 02:12.880
What has Madam been
doing these past few days?

02:13.280 --> 02:14.440
Meng Huaijin has just passed.

02:14.520 --> 02:15.800
She returned home for mourning.

02:19.000 --> 02:20.560
Keep an eye on her and the Meng family.

02:21.200 --> 02:22.600
The Mengs have lost their heir.

02:23.200 --> 02:24.600
They surely won't relent so easily.

02:25.080 --> 02:25.680
Understood.

02:26.560 --> 02:30.360
(Meng Residence)

02:43.440 --> 02:44.240
Huaijin!

02:46.480 --> 02:47.240
Huaijin!

02:48.520 --> 02:49.320
Huaijin!

02:49.920 --> 02:50.600
Huaijin!

02:50.920 --> 02:51.960
- Madam.
- Huaijin!

02:52.760 --> 02:53.920
- Huaijin!
- Madam.

02:54.320 --> 02:54.920
Come.

02:55.880 --> 02:56.480
Calm down.

03:00.160 --> 03:00.760
Madam.

03:04.640 --> 03:06.040
Huaijin was

03:06.600 --> 03:07.840
a convicted man.

03:08.560 --> 03:11.440
To be buried intact
in a coffin is already

03:12.240 --> 03:13.720
His Majesty's grace.

03:16.280 --> 03:17.880
With such conduct,

03:19.000 --> 03:20.320
do you still intend

03:21.080 --> 03:22.920
to bring more trouble
upon the Meng family?

03:27.840 --> 03:29.600
The dead are gone like a snuffed lamp.

03:31.360 --> 03:33.920
Huaijin died for the sake
of the entire Meng clan.

03:35.840 --> 03:38.000
Father, would you not
allow me to grieve?

03:42.200 --> 03:43.840
I wish to speak with Zhenzhen.

03:46.320 --> 03:47.320
You may all leave.

04:04.240 --> 04:06.520
I know you hold resentment in you.

04:07.440 --> 04:09.440
But for the sake
of the entire Meng family,

04:10.120 --> 04:11.520
we had no choice

04:12.560 --> 04:14.520
but to give up your brother.

04:17.920 --> 04:21.079
Huaijin was the legitimate heir
I raised with my own hands.

04:21.760 --> 04:22.600
But now,

04:23.680 --> 04:25.440
I must send off my own son.

04:28.360 --> 04:30.080
The pain in my heart…

04:33.960 --> 04:35.640
is greater than yours.

04:37.480 --> 04:38.840
If not for

04:38.960 --> 04:41.400
that cursed Shen Zaiye,

04:42.120 --> 04:43.200
how would our family

04:44.200 --> 04:46.320
end up in this predicament?

04:48.520 --> 04:50.480
Though His Majesty
did not hold us accountable,

04:52.560 --> 04:53.520
at this moment,

04:55.120 --> 04:56.480
the Meng family line

04:56.920 --> 04:58.480
is already far from what it once was.

05:00.360 --> 05:01.680
Those who came to mourn today

05:02.640 --> 05:04.600
were none but those
with the Meng surname.

05:06.800 --> 05:08.840
Not a single outsider showed up.

05:12.080 --> 05:13.560
You and Shen Zaiye

05:14.240 --> 05:16.280
have been married for many years.

05:17.080 --> 05:19.840
When he struck against
the Meng family so ruthlessly,

05:21.080 --> 05:23.360
did he not even spare a single thought

05:23.440 --> 05:26.000
for the bond you two shared
as husband and wife?

05:30.160 --> 05:31.400
Meng Huaijin!

05:33.760 --> 05:35.440
Your own blood brother,

05:35.520 --> 05:37.440
my only heir!

05:41.240 --> 05:42.120
If you must hate,

05:44.000 --> 05:45.360
then hate him.

05:47.120 --> 05:48.920
You can't swallow this anger,

05:49.440 --> 05:51.760
but neither can I!

05:55.720 --> 05:57.480
Now that he has rendered great service,

05:58.760 --> 06:01.360
he's now at the height of his power.

06:03.480 --> 06:05.960
What use is it if you can't let this go?

06:06.040 --> 06:07.440
At the height of his power?

06:10.760 --> 06:13.040
You call that the height of his power?

06:15.520 --> 06:17.480
He is nothing but a treacherous man.

06:18.200 --> 06:19.560
He rose to power overnight.

06:20.600 --> 06:21.640
And now he seeks

06:22.320 --> 06:24.480
to wipe out the Meng family at its root.

06:27.400 --> 06:28.880
He has humiliated our family

06:29.600 --> 06:31.160
so thoroughly.

06:34.000 --> 06:34.800
Should we not

06:36.280 --> 06:37.120
avenge this?

06:54.200 --> 06:55.400
There is something

06:57.120 --> 06:58.280
I must entrust to you.

07:05.200 --> 07:06.000
This item

07:07.560 --> 07:08.680
is tasteless and odorless.

07:09.880 --> 07:11.200
Ingesting it causes instant death.

07:13.840 --> 07:14.880
Let Shen Zaiye

07:16.080 --> 07:17.440
pay with his life for your brother.

07:20.280 --> 07:21.120
Father,

07:23.040 --> 07:24.760
you want me to poison him?

07:25.440 --> 07:26.800
You are his wife.

07:28.000 --> 07:29.120
You have plenty of chances.

07:39.280 --> 07:40.840
Have you ever thought, Father,

07:43.000 --> 07:44.640
what will happen to me

07:49.040 --> 07:51.040
if I fail this mission?

07:56.800 --> 07:57.720
Do it for your brother.

07:59.040 --> 08:00.040
For the Meng family.

08:11.480 --> 08:18.480
(Meng Residence)

08:26.040 --> 08:27.600
The young master has only just passed.

08:28.000 --> 08:29.960
Yet, Master wants you to take a life.

08:31.120 --> 08:32.600
The risks aside,

08:33.440 --> 08:35.760
just the fact that
you still love the Chancellor…

08:37.200 --> 08:38.400
(When you see this letter,
I am already gone.)

08:38.480 --> 08:39.600
Master should not…

08:39.679 --> 08:40.799
(Farewell, Meng Huaijin.)

08:42.919 --> 08:44.360
Father has always been this way.

08:45.720 --> 08:47.120
Otherwise Huaijin wouldn't have…

08:53.880 --> 08:55.480
Has the Chancellor made a move lately?

08:56.440 --> 08:57.480
What moves could there be?

08:58.080 --> 09:00.160
He just goes to Zhengchun Boudoir
every single day.

09:01.600 --> 09:02.800
I also heard that

09:03.040 --> 09:04.680
the Chancellor went
to the palace himself

09:05.040 --> 09:06.720
to request princessly
privileges for her.

09:08.120 --> 09:09.240
He even plans to take her

09:09.320 --> 09:10.760
to Consort Lan's tea banquet.

09:12.640 --> 09:15.040
Bringing a concubine
to a palace banquet?

09:15.440 --> 09:16.400
Outrageous.

09:18.240 --> 09:19.880
He doesn't care for your dignity.

09:20.920 --> 09:22.320
Now that Huaijin is gone,

09:24.520 --> 09:25.440
there is no one left

09:25.520 --> 09:26.880
who will put me first anymore.

09:28.680 --> 09:31.280
Neither my husband's side
nor my own family.

09:33.160 --> 09:35.640
Who would care about
the dignity of an unloved wife?

09:39.080 --> 09:41.840
(The Chancellor promised to take care
of you. Farewell, Meng Huaijin)

09:59.800 --> 10:02.200
Among the maids
we placed in the Heir's Residence,

10:03.040 --> 10:04.360
was there an obedient one?

10:06.400 --> 10:07.840
There is one named Nanli.

10:08.120 --> 10:09.320
She signed a death contract.

10:10.320 --> 10:11.600
After the incident with the Heir,

10:11.880 --> 10:13.440
she went into palace service.

10:16.440 --> 10:18.200
The Meng family has
trained her for years.

10:20.040 --> 10:21.560
It is time for her to be of use.

10:23.400 --> 10:24.600
Madam, do you mean to…

10:28.120 --> 10:29.440
If there is no way to have both,

10:30.560 --> 10:32.000
then I will be the one to choose.

10:33.080 --> 10:34.560
It should be me who steps aside.

10:36.160 --> 10:37.600
So no one will be caught in between.

10:38.640 --> 10:39.880
No one speaks well of me anyway.

10:42.360 --> 10:42.960
Yes.

10:50.680 --> 10:51.880
It has come to this bitter end

10:53.840 --> 10:55.720
for you and me.

11:04.640 --> 11:08.720
(Shen Residence)

11:09.280 --> 11:09.880
Zhan Lu.

11:10.320 --> 11:11.480
During Her Highness's recovery,

11:11.560 --> 11:13.000
she likely can't leave her chambers.

11:13.840 --> 11:15.680
Prepare more silk pillows
made of Su satin,

11:16.160 --> 11:17.680
and flowers and fruits.

11:18.480 --> 11:19.080
Chancellor.

11:19.440 --> 11:21.160
You've never shown
such concern for anyone.

11:21.520 --> 11:22.400
It is not like you.

11:25.440 --> 11:26.040
She isn't

11:27.040 --> 11:27.640
just anyone.

11:31.400 --> 11:32.320
Since that is the case,

11:32.400 --> 11:33.880
why not show it yourself, Chancellor?

11:36.680 --> 11:38.720
Are you saying
Her Highness is slow-witted

11:39.520 --> 11:40.600
and even such thoughts

11:40.680 --> 11:42.640
must be explained to her by me?

11:43.120 --> 11:43.760
I wouldn't dare.

11:44.160 --> 11:46.200
You and Her Highness are both brilliant.

11:46.280 --> 11:47.680
You are truly a perfect match.

11:48.040 --> 11:50.200
How could Her Highness
not understand your thoughts?

12:08.720 --> 12:10.440
(Xie)

12:27.200 --> 12:28.000
Zhan Lu.

12:29.960 --> 12:30.920
What are you doing?

12:32.720 --> 12:34.280
This was prepared for you to attend

12:34.400 --> 12:35.120
the tea banquet.

12:35.720 --> 12:36.400
Your Highness,

12:36.600 --> 12:37.640
look at this embroidery.

12:37.720 --> 12:39.640
It is even finer
than what Lan Boutique offers.

12:40.440 --> 12:41.920
The Chancellor petitioned His Majesty

12:42.360 --> 12:44.480
and requested palace embroiderers
to make it for you.

12:47.520 --> 12:50.040
The standards
of these ornaments and garments

12:51.040 --> 12:53.600
are beyond even what the official wife
in the household may wear.

12:54.280 --> 12:55.640
I am only a concubine.

12:56.000 --> 12:57.200
This doesn't seem appropriate.

12:58.200 --> 12:58.960
The Chancellor says

12:59.280 --> 13:00.480
that for this tea banquet,

13:00.880 --> 13:03.200
you will be attending
as Princess Chengping.

13:03.640 --> 13:05.120
So these garments and accessories

13:05.440 --> 13:06.600
must come from the palace

13:06.840 --> 13:08.040
to befit your status.

13:08.200 --> 13:08.800
You…

13:09.120 --> 13:10.160
What did you just call me?

13:11.520 --> 13:12.280
The Chancellor says

13:12.680 --> 13:13.480
that from now on,

13:13.720 --> 13:15.800
everyone here
is to address you as Your Highness.

13:15.920 --> 13:17.240
- Your Highness.
- Your Highness.

13:17.720 --> 13:19.000
Anyone who disrespects you

13:19.240 --> 13:20.440
disrespects the Chancellor,

13:20.520 --> 13:22.280
and will be dealt with
under household law.

13:56.280 --> 13:56.880
Chancellor.

13:59.520 --> 14:00.320
Reporting in.

14:00.760 --> 14:02.800
Madam hasn't left her quarters
since her return.

14:03.320 --> 14:04.840
But her maid, Yuetao,

14:05.000 --> 14:06.080
secretly went to the palace

14:06.160 --> 14:07.240
to meet a young maid, Nanli.

14:07.600 --> 14:09.320
She used to serve
in the Heir's Residence.

14:10.640 --> 14:11.520
Keep watch on those

14:12.880 --> 14:13.480
in the palace.

14:13.560 --> 14:14.160
Yes.

14:21.240 --> 14:24.840
(Shen Residence)

14:27.520 --> 14:28.200
Place these

14:28.360 --> 14:29.120
in that carriage.

14:30.840 --> 14:31.720
Put those by the side

14:32.000 --> 14:33.000
in the one at the back.

14:36.600 --> 14:37.640
Be careful with everything.

14:42.120 --> 14:43.280
Her Highness has arrived.

15:18.520 --> 15:19.800
Greetings to Princess Chengping.

15:21.040 --> 15:23.480
- Greetings to Princess Chengping.
- Greetings to Princess Chengping.

15:24.800 --> 15:25.800
At ease, everyone.

15:33.560 --> 15:35.240
Zhenzhen, please rise.

15:39.200 --> 15:39.960
Your Highness, wait.

15:41.560 --> 15:42.440
The journey is tiring.

15:43.000 --> 15:45.160
I'm sure it will lift
the Chancellor's spirits

15:45.400 --> 15:46.560
to have you by his side.

15:47.280 --> 15:48.560
I'll switch places with you

15:48.920 --> 15:50.160
and ride in the one at the back.

15:55.200 --> 15:55.800
Your Highness.

16:00.320 --> 16:01.720
Zaiye, the palace banquet is boring.

16:01.880 --> 16:02.960
I'll hang out with Mu Wuxia.

16:38.600 --> 16:39.200
Not bad.

16:39.920 --> 16:41.480
At last, you look a bit like a princess.

16:44.320 --> 16:45.280
Usually,

16:45.680 --> 16:47.160
just having your favor

16:48.000 --> 16:49.560
was already enough to stir resentment.

16:50.480 --> 16:51.160
And now,

16:51.480 --> 16:52.920
you are using my title as a princess.

16:53.760 --> 16:56.360
Who knows
what you are planning this time?

17:00.040 --> 17:01.160
You'll find out soon enough.

17:03.720 --> 17:04.920
Always so secretive.

17:26.160 --> 17:27.960
- Great!
- Yeah!

17:28.319 --> 17:31.600
- Brilliant!
- Great!

17:31.680 --> 17:32.720
One more!

17:34.040 --> 17:35.640
- Amazing!
- Great!

17:35.880 --> 17:36.800
- Impressive!
- Good!

17:37.400 --> 17:38.000
Splendid!

17:38.640 --> 17:39.320
One more!

17:40.320 --> 17:44.360
- Great!
- Yeah!

17:45.120 --> 17:45.720
Great!

17:45.800 --> 17:46.520
One more!

17:57.360 --> 17:59.760
Chancellor Shen has arrived.

18:00.320 --> 18:01.280
This way, Chancellor.

18:06.680 --> 18:08.800
- Greetings, Chancellor Shen.
- Greetings, Chancellor Shen.

18:15.320 --> 18:16.000
Right Chancellor.

18:20.000 --> 18:20.720
Right Chancellor.

18:21.200 --> 18:22.480
Your seat is over there.

18:38.680 --> 18:39.280
Father.

18:39.720 --> 18:41.160
Your seat has quite the view.

18:41.560 --> 18:42.760
I'd like to sit with you.

19:07.760 --> 19:08.400
Official Qin.

19:09.000 --> 19:09.720
This way, please.

19:14.080 --> 19:16.800
Congratulations on your promotion
to Minister-in-Chief, Official Qin.

19:16.920 --> 19:19.120
The Minister-in-Chief is
a pillar of the court.

19:19.400 --> 19:21.560
You have the support of all,
Official Qin.

19:21.720 --> 19:23.920
Congratulations, it is well deserved.

19:25.320 --> 19:26.240
You flatter me.

19:29.000 --> 19:30.040
This is retribution.

19:31.040 --> 19:32.640
No fortune lasts forever.

19:34.400 --> 19:36.640
The Heir was deposed,
Meng Huaijin took his own life.

19:37.280 --> 19:39.400
The Meng family has suffered
a heavy blow this time.

19:40.680 --> 19:41.920
Everyone here is sharp.

19:42.640 --> 19:43.560
Naturally, you all know

19:43.960 --> 19:45.320
that the title of First Family

19:46.080 --> 19:47.280
now belongs to the Qin family.

19:57.280 --> 19:58.600
The Right Chancellor seems

19:59.480 --> 20:00.800
to have planned this all along.

20:02.640 --> 20:04.440
Will the Meng family rise again?

20:06.280 --> 20:07.520
A dynasty lasts a hundred years.

20:07.600 --> 20:09.000
A noble clan endures for a thousand.

20:09.840 --> 20:10.880
All these years,

20:11.120 --> 20:13.240
the Meng family's power in court
has grown deep roots.

20:14.400 --> 20:16.000
They will not fall so easily.

20:17.760 --> 20:19.400
But if they wish to rise to power again,

20:20.480 --> 20:22.400
I won't give them the chance.

20:58.440 --> 21:00.320
His Majesty has arrived.

21:00.760 --> 21:02.480
We welcome His Majesty.

21:02.680 --> 21:03.680
Rise.

21:03.800 --> 21:06.200
- Greetings to Your Majesty.
- Greetings to Your Majesty.

21:09.880 --> 21:11.440
At ease, my loyal officials.

21:11.760 --> 21:12.920
Today is a family banquet.

21:13.200 --> 21:14.080
Let us be at ease.

21:14.600 --> 21:15.200
Be seated.

21:15.400 --> 21:17.560
- Thank you, Your Majesty.
- Thank you, Your Majesty.

21:20.600 --> 21:23.320
His Majesty, acknowledging
the efforts of the officials,

21:23.520 --> 21:24.920
has arranged this tea banquet.

21:25.360 --> 21:28.480
Fine tea is now served.
May all of you enjoy it

21:28.640 --> 21:29.960
and bask in His Majesty's grace.

22:27.920 --> 22:29.800
Chancellor Shen, Your Highness,
enjoy the tea.

22:32.160 --> 22:32.760
Wait.

22:41.560 --> 22:44.080
There is no harm
in drinking this tea a bit later.

22:45.800 --> 22:47.320
(He looks so calm and composed.)

22:48.360 --> 22:50.400
(He must have known
about the tea beforehand.)

22:56.720 --> 22:57.320
Your Majesty.

22:57.920 --> 22:59.440
I've recently acquired a rare treasure.

22:59.760 --> 23:01.000
It suits this banquet

23:01.280 --> 23:02.680
perfectly.

23:03.280 --> 23:04.400
I'd like to present it.

23:05.520 --> 23:07.640
If it has caught Chancellor Shen's eye,

23:07.760 --> 23:08.920
then it must be extraordinary.

23:09.640 --> 23:10.680
Let us have a look.

23:11.120 --> 23:11.720
Yes.

23:15.320 --> 23:16.880
Is that not just a glazed cups?

23:17.240 --> 23:19.400
The palace often uses
glazed cups for tea.

23:19.560 --> 23:20.320
Nothing special.

23:21.160 --> 23:21.760
Your Highness.

23:22.200 --> 23:23.800
This glazed cup is unlike the others.

23:23.880 --> 23:24.800
Its greatest difference

23:25.080 --> 23:26.760
is that when it touches poison,

23:27.080 --> 23:29.560
the clear wall of the cup
will turn cloudy.

23:30.760 --> 23:32.640
You and His Majesty
are of peerless prestige.

23:32.840 --> 23:34.480
If you use this cup to drink tea,

23:34.880 --> 23:36.360
it will surely be much safer.

23:37.840 --> 23:38.480
Present it.

23:42.920 --> 23:43.720
Come, my consort.

23:46.280 --> 23:46.880
Your Majesty.

23:47.200 --> 23:47.960
I've prepared

23:48.360 --> 23:49.760
more of this glazed cup.

23:50.200 --> 23:51.360
If Your Majesty doesn't mind,

23:51.600 --> 23:54.080
why not use these
for today's tea banquet?

23:56.360 --> 23:56.960
Your Majesty.

23:57.360 --> 23:59.200
These cups are indeed finely crafted.

23:59.520 --> 24:01.880
They might even bring out
better color in the tea.

24:04.080 --> 24:05.720
Since my consort says so,

24:06.960 --> 24:07.800
then so be it.

24:09.520 --> 24:10.480
My dear officials.

24:11.280 --> 24:12.520
For today's tea,

24:12.920 --> 24:14.160
we shall all use these cups.

24:25.160 --> 24:26.240
(So the Chancellor)

24:26.560 --> 24:28.560
(has turned the trap back onto them.)

24:29.000 --> 24:30.480
(I shall act accordingly.)

24:58.840 --> 24:59.440
You…

25:08.200 --> 25:09.080
Foolish.

25:30.400 --> 25:31.000
Pour it.

25:35.520 --> 25:36.120
Pour it.

25:46.160 --> 25:47.520
(It really is the Meng family.)

25:48.640 --> 25:50.320
(What is Meng Zhenzhen's role)

25:51.000 --> 25:52.040
(in this plot?)

25:53.160 --> 25:53.920
You may go.

26:01.200 --> 26:02.400
Right Chancellor, what is this?

26:02.840 --> 26:04.480
Today, we are not in the court.

26:04.800 --> 26:07.040
There is no need to be
bound by our official titles.

26:08.400 --> 26:09.360
Or is it that

26:09.640 --> 26:10.640
because of what happened

26:10.880 --> 26:12.000
with the Heir,

26:12.360 --> 26:14.440
you now wish to
draw a clear line between us?

26:16.920 --> 26:18.000
Not at all, Father-in-law.

26:18.520 --> 26:19.720
I only feel

26:20.480 --> 26:21.520
guilt toward your family

26:21.840 --> 26:23.640
because of what happened to Huaijin.

26:24.120 --> 26:25.640
I didn't dare approach and disturb you.

26:27.360 --> 26:28.360
It seems

26:29.040 --> 26:30.280
I have misunderstood.

26:31.920 --> 26:33.120
As for the matter of the Heir,

26:33.520 --> 26:34.520
the verdict is final.

26:35.320 --> 26:37.240
I hope you will let it end there.

26:39.920 --> 26:40.520
Come.

26:40.960 --> 26:42.560
I offer tea in place of wine.

26:43.640 --> 26:44.400
All that happened

26:44.720 --> 26:45.680
and all past grievances

26:46.440 --> 26:47.320
shall be written off.

26:55.360 --> 26:56.040
Pour the tea.

27:05.640 --> 27:06.720
This tea has gone cold.

27:07.240 --> 27:08.240
Brew a fresh pot.

27:09.240 --> 27:09.840
Yes.

27:09.960 --> 27:10.560
Wait.

27:18.880 --> 27:20.080
But I feel

27:20.240 --> 27:21.800
this tea is just the right temperature.

27:22.320 --> 27:23.640
Why go to the trouble?

27:25.240 --> 27:25.920
Pour the tea.

27:29.520 --> 27:30.160
Allow me.

27:59.480 --> 28:00.320
Right Chancellor Meng.

28:01.000 --> 28:01.800
What is the matter?

28:04.560 --> 28:06.320
An old ailment has flared up.

28:07.040 --> 28:08.200
I lost my composure.

28:08.840 --> 28:10.560
Please forgive me.

28:22.160 --> 28:23.560
Jiang Taohua, what is wrong?

28:23.880 --> 28:24.480
Jiang Taohua?

28:26.000 --> 28:26.760
Princess Chengping?

28:27.360 --> 28:28.160
Princess Chengping?

28:29.560 --> 28:30.280
Minister Shen.

28:31.200 --> 28:32.760
What is wrong with Princess Chengping?

28:33.120 --> 28:33.720
Your Majesty.

28:34.000 --> 28:35.200
Princess Chengping fainted.

28:35.520 --> 28:37.520
Someone must have poisoned
the tea at this banquet

28:37.800 --> 28:38.680
to harm me.

28:39.280 --> 28:40.160
Please investigate.

28:43.520 --> 28:44.360
Summon the physician.

29:00.920 --> 29:01.520
Your Majesty.

29:01.600 --> 29:03.760
Examine the cups of tea
before Princess Chengping.

29:04.160 --> 29:04.760
Yes.

29:05.000 --> 29:06.600
Escort the Consort back to her chambers.

29:06.960 --> 29:07.560
Your Majesty.

29:07.920 --> 29:08.520
It's fine.

29:27.400 --> 29:28.200
Your Majesty.

29:29.480 --> 29:31.080
I have thoroughly examined the matter.

29:31.320 --> 29:33.680
There was poison in the tea cup
on Chancellor Shen's table.

29:34.120 --> 29:36.680
Fortunately, Princess Chengping
only drank a small amount.

29:36.800 --> 29:37.920
She is not in serious danger.

29:44.400 --> 29:47.000
- Your Majesty, please calm your anger.
- Your Majesty, please calm your anger.

29:47.920 --> 29:48.640
Wretched maid.

29:51.080 --> 29:51.960
Speak.

29:52.760 --> 29:53.640
Who ordered you

29:53.720 --> 29:55.400
to poison the drinks at my banquet?

29:56.200 --> 29:57.360
Spare me, Your Majesty.

29:57.680 --> 29:58.680
It was Ms. Meng.

29:58.960 --> 30:00.360
She told me to do it.

30:00.480 --> 30:01.880
She gave me the poison.

30:02.120 --> 30:02.800
Miss!

30:02.880 --> 30:04.400
Miss, say something!

30:17.080 --> 30:18.080
Forgive me, Your Majesty.

30:19.120 --> 30:20.880
I acted alone in this matter.

30:22.520 --> 30:23.480
The others are innocent.

30:28.280 --> 30:29.160
Lady Meng.

30:30.520 --> 30:32.440
You are Chancellor Shen's rightful wife,

30:32.560 --> 30:34.040
the legitimate daughter of the family.

30:34.760 --> 30:36.280
How did it come to this?

30:40.920 --> 30:42.720
Shen Zaiye harmed my brother.

30:43.560 --> 30:44.680
He dotes on a concubine.

30:45.920 --> 30:46.800
Does he even care

30:46.880 --> 30:48.280
about my place as his lawful wife?

30:49.560 --> 30:52.160
Your Majesty tells me to consider
our bond as husband and wife.

30:53.920 --> 30:55.840
But has he ever
shown me the same regard?

30:55.960 --> 30:56.680
Insolence!

30:58.640 --> 31:00.480
As a noble lady,

31:01.440 --> 31:02.680
how could you be so vicious?

31:04.000 --> 31:06.040
You should be caned to death
as a warning to others.

31:06.120 --> 31:07.400
Your Majesty, wait.

31:11.320 --> 31:12.200
This is outrageous!

31:14.440 --> 31:15.440
Calm down, Your Majesty.

31:17.000 --> 31:19.160
My daughter has committed
an unforgivable crime.

31:19.560 --> 31:21.440
It is my failure as a father.

31:21.960 --> 31:23.280
Whatever punishment you deem fit,

31:23.880 --> 31:24.600
I shall have

31:24.960 --> 31:26.160
no objections.

31:27.480 --> 31:28.360
However,

31:28.960 --> 31:31.360
I have only just laid my son to rest.

31:31.960 --> 31:34.320
Now I have only this daughter left.

31:37.440 --> 31:38.280
I am

31:39.080 --> 31:40.680
willing to step down from office.

31:41.120 --> 31:41.720
I will offer

31:41.800 --> 31:42.920
the seat of Right Chancellor

31:43.160 --> 31:45.480
in exchange for my daughter's life.

31:51.080 --> 31:51.800
Chancellor Shen,

31:53.240 --> 31:54.120
in your opinion,

31:54.640 --> 31:56.000
how should this matter be handled?

31:59.360 --> 32:00.680
I beg Your Majesty for mercy.

32:02.000 --> 32:03.600
Ms. Meng has always
been virtuous and kind.

32:03.680 --> 32:04.520
She is generous.

32:05.440 --> 32:06.280
Her actions today

32:06.560 --> 32:07.440
are out of character.

32:09.560 --> 32:10.320
(It seems)

32:10.960 --> 32:12.600
(she has taken a desperate gamble today)

32:13.360 --> 32:14.960
(and made herself a discarded piece)

32:15.840 --> 32:17.320
(just to find closure.)

32:19.880 --> 32:21.000
There must be more to this.

32:21.800 --> 32:22.760
We need your judgment.

32:24.240 --> 32:25.760
I too ask for Your Majesty's mercy.

32:26.440 --> 32:28.120
It was my fault for being favored

32:28.240 --> 32:29.120
and becoming arrogant.

32:29.800 --> 32:31.360
I've shown misdemeanor in the family.

32:31.680 --> 32:33.480
That must have caused her
to lose her reason,

32:33.760 --> 32:34.800
and commit this crime.

32:35.720 --> 32:37.120
Sister only acted out of impulse.

32:37.400 --> 32:38.320
She deserves mercy.

32:40.240 --> 32:41.000
I beg Your Majesty

32:41.600 --> 32:42.560
to show mercy.

32:44.040 --> 32:44.880
What happened today

32:45.680 --> 32:46.560
all stemmed from me.

32:47.520 --> 32:50.000
If I hadn't neglected her,

32:50.600 --> 32:53.040
Lady Meng would never have
committed such a grave mistake.

32:54.120 --> 32:54.720
Today,

32:54.920 --> 32:56.080
I wish to ask Your Majesty

32:56.640 --> 32:57.520
to grant me

32:57.920 --> 32:59.120
and Lady Meng a divorce.

32:59.560 --> 33:00.680
We'll go our separate ways,

33:01.000 --> 33:01.880
seeking our own peace.

33:07.120 --> 33:07.800
Chancellor Shen,

33:09.000 --> 33:10.080
have you made up your mind?

33:11.000 --> 33:11.800
I have.

33:12.640 --> 33:13.760
When I return to the manor,

33:14.080 --> 33:15.400
I shall also send away

33:15.560 --> 33:16.560
Lady Qin

33:16.880 --> 33:17.560
and Lady Duan.

33:18.480 --> 33:19.560
Today, Princess Chengping

33:19.880 --> 33:20.960
was nearly poisoned.

33:21.640 --> 33:22.240
It was

33:22.520 --> 33:24.320
caused by the disorder in my household.

33:25.080 --> 33:26.400
Over this recent period of time,

33:27.000 --> 33:28.320
my bond with Princess Chengping

33:28.440 --> 33:29.360
has grown ever deeper.

33:30.280 --> 33:31.040
We are each other's

33:31.120 --> 33:32.000
love of a lifetime.

33:33.840 --> 33:34.560
If unresolved,

33:34.800 --> 33:37.040
someone might attempt to murder
the princess again.

33:37.920 --> 33:38.600
Chancellor Shen,

33:38.840 --> 33:39.760
wives and concubines

33:39.920 --> 33:41.800
need not resort to ruin or conflict.

33:41.920 --> 33:42.960
Lady Meng made a mistake,

33:43.120 --> 33:45.440
but that does not mean my daughter
would do the same.

33:45.920 --> 33:46.680
Chancellor Shen,

33:47.000 --> 33:48.840
you are worrying over nothing.

33:49.160 --> 33:49.760
Exactly.

33:50.240 --> 33:51.280
Yunxin has always been

33:51.840 --> 33:53.320
gentle and considerate.

33:53.480 --> 33:55.240
She would never commit
such a vicious act.

33:55.320 --> 33:56.120
My lords,

33:56.880 --> 33:58.520
Lady Qin and Lady Duan

33:58.960 --> 34:00.240
are both my concubines.

34:00.880 --> 34:01.720
By propriety,

34:02.160 --> 34:03.520
I have the right to divorce them.

34:04.520 --> 34:05.920
But since trouble has arisen today,

34:06.400 --> 34:07.600
I may as well explain it

34:07.680 --> 34:08.400
to all of you.

34:09.639 --> 34:10.920
Lady Qin and Lady Duan

34:11.199 --> 34:12.000
are both virtuous.

34:12.520 --> 34:14.199
They have done nothing to wrong me.

34:14.600 --> 34:16.120
Rather, it is I who have wronged them.

34:17.000 --> 34:19.000
Daughters of noble families
can always find suitors.

34:19.360 --> 34:20.800
If they remarry in the future,

34:21.080 --> 34:23.040
I shall regard them both

34:23.120 --> 34:24.239
as dearly as younger sisters.

34:26.400 --> 34:27.000
Your Majesty,

34:27.800 --> 34:28.920
if Princess Chengping

34:29.320 --> 34:30.239
were ever harmed again

34:31.040 --> 34:32.080
because of family matter,

34:32.840 --> 34:33.760
it'd be hard to explain

34:34.360 --> 34:35.600
to those from Beiyuan.

34:45.719 --> 34:46.400
Very well, then.

34:47.080 --> 34:48.360
We'll proceed as you proposed.

34:48.880 --> 34:49.880
I shall show mercy.

34:50.800 --> 34:52.639
- Thank you for your mercy.
- Thank you for your mercy.

34:53.040 --> 34:53.960
Right Chancellor Meng.

34:54.280 --> 34:55.600
Take your daughter home,

34:55.760 --> 34:56.719
and discipline her well.

34:57.760 --> 34:58.880
Thank you, Your Majesty.

35:00.480 --> 35:01.560
As for this maid,

35:03.000 --> 35:03.720
death by caning.

35:04.160 --> 35:05.120
Have mercy, Your Majesty.

35:05.280 --> 35:06.120
I'm sorry!

35:06.440 --> 35:08.560
Spare me, Your Majesty. I'm sorry!

35:13.520 --> 35:14.120
Father.

35:30.880 --> 35:31.480
Enough.

35:34.040 --> 35:35.720
Everything you did today

35:36.520 --> 35:37.680
was understandable.

35:39.360 --> 35:40.720
I should not have forced you.

35:43.360 --> 35:44.240
Father,

35:45.360 --> 35:46.240
I have burdened you.

35:49.440 --> 35:51.120
It is only a job.

35:53.040 --> 35:54.520
Your safety matters more.

36:11.360 --> 36:12.480
You and Huaijin

36:13.160 --> 36:14.280
are both my children.

36:14.960 --> 36:16.200
Huaijin gave his life

36:16.800 --> 36:17.920
to protect the family.

36:19.400 --> 36:20.360
With his last breath,

36:21.040 --> 36:22.400
he still thought of you.

36:24.080 --> 36:25.720
You acted for yourself.

36:26.120 --> 36:27.160
Call it selfish,

36:28.480 --> 36:29.440
yet it is not wrong.

36:35.920 --> 36:37.000
Even so,

36:38.280 --> 36:39.520
what is done is done.

36:41.240 --> 36:42.120
Come home.

36:46.080 --> 36:47.160
From now on you and I

36:48.280 --> 36:49.320
will only have each other.

37:09.520 --> 37:10.120
Master.

37:10.480 --> 37:11.840
Judging by what happened,

37:12.240 --> 37:14.000
His Majesty didn't mean to punish her.

37:14.240 --> 37:15.800
Why give up your post?

37:16.320 --> 37:18.800
Did you not see
how today's seating was laid out?

37:20.240 --> 37:21.920
If His Majesty hadn't agreed to it,

37:22.760 --> 37:24.680
who would dare put the Meng family last?

37:25.400 --> 37:26.280
The Meng family

37:26.760 --> 37:28.720
has never suffered such humiliation.

37:31.240 --> 37:33.800
With His Majesty's view of us now,

37:34.640 --> 37:36.080
the Chancellor's title

37:36.480 --> 37:37.480
is just an empty shell.

37:38.360 --> 37:40.080
It's better to step back for the moment

37:41.360 --> 37:43.720
to leave a good impression
on His Majesty,

37:44.280 --> 37:45.160
and keep

37:45.360 --> 37:47.880
some leverage for our comeback.

37:49.520 --> 37:50.240
Besides…

37:53.640 --> 37:54.560
I'm getting old,

37:56.000 --> 37:57.280
and Huaijin is gone.

38:53.800 --> 38:54.960
You both have my thanks.

38:55.600 --> 38:56.400
No need to thank me.

38:57.200 --> 38:59.280
I know none of this was your choice.

39:00.040 --> 39:00.880
You're no fool.

39:01.640 --> 39:03.160
Without your family pushing you,

39:03.480 --> 39:04.800
you'd never pull

39:04.880 --> 39:06.360
a stunt that harms everyone.

39:07.360 --> 39:07.960
Still,

39:08.200 --> 39:09.480
you chose your path.

39:10.000 --> 39:10.760
From now on,

39:11.000 --> 39:12.240
we walk separate paths.

39:12.960 --> 39:14.200
No need for more questioning.

39:15.200 --> 39:15.800
It's better

39:16.000 --> 39:16.600
this way

39:17.080 --> 39:17.680
for us both.

39:21.200 --> 39:21.800
Take care.

39:30.280 --> 39:30.960
Ms. Meng,

39:31.840 --> 39:32.960
may I have a word?

39:37.760 --> 39:39.840
You still call me Ms. Meng.

39:41.440 --> 39:42.680
After all that happened today,

39:43.160 --> 39:45.240
are you finally freed
from your shackles?

39:47.440 --> 39:48.040
It will.

39:48.720 --> 39:49.680
Thank you, Your Highness.

39:51.600 --> 39:53.240
I hope that once the burden is gone,

39:53.840 --> 39:55.240
you can truly feel at ease.

39:58.400 --> 39:59.200
Did you know

40:00.120 --> 40:01.720
from the first day you came,

40:02.440 --> 40:04.040
I've done many things to harm you?

40:05.520 --> 40:07.200
I made trouble for you
on the wedding day,

40:07.880 --> 40:09.000
lured you to the study,

40:09.920 --> 40:11.960
planted discord
between you and the Chancellor,

40:13.000 --> 40:14.560
and I even tried to poison you.

40:16.000 --> 40:17.080
Knowing all of this,

40:19.600 --> 40:21.080
why are you still willing to help me?

40:21.640 --> 40:23.800
You acted only for your family.

40:28.800 --> 40:30.440
As the first daughter
of the Meng family,

40:31.080 --> 40:32.440
every word and deed of mine

40:33.000 --> 40:35.240
can never follow my own wish.

40:36.520 --> 40:38.440
Though in name
I am your lady of the house,

40:41.680 --> 40:43.320
I actually envy you a lot.

40:43.840 --> 40:44.720
Envy me?

40:47.200 --> 40:48.760
We haven't known each other long,

40:49.480 --> 40:50.480
yet in my heart,

40:51.200 --> 40:53.400
I always felt you and I are alike.

40:54.800 --> 40:56.320
I was born a Meng,

40:56.960 --> 40:59.120
so from the start, my life was bound

40:59.600 --> 41:02.000
by family and status.

41:03.200 --> 41:04.560
You journeyed to another land,

41:05.440 --> 41:07.160
free from the restraints of your family.

41:08.160 --> 41:09.840
You follow your own heart,

41:10.400 --> 41:11.720
and do what you wish.

41:13.600 --> 41:15.040
Such a free life

41:16.400 --> 41:18.360
is exactly what I long for.

41:22.360 --> 41:23.760
So you let the whole plot unfold

41:24.240 --> 41:25.640
on purpose?

41:27.040 --> 41:28.720
That maid confessed without hesitation,

41:29.640 --> 41:31.120
which must have been in your script.

41:33.240 --> 41:35.200
You truly have a sharp mind.

41:36.760 --> 41:37.640
Most of my life

41:38.240 --> 41:39.560
has been out of my hands.

41:41.000 --> 41:42.080
Yet today,

41:43.000 --> 41:45.000
between myself and my family,

41:46.360 --> 41:47.960
I made a selfish choice.

41:49.880 --> 41:50.600
In the end,

41:51.400 --> 41:52.000
you,

41:52.360 --> 41:52.960
I,

41:53.120 --> 41:53.880
and the Chancellor

41:54.320 --> 41:55.400
all think with clear heads.

41:56.800 --> 41:58.720
We weigh our choices, not our feelings.

41:59.160 --> 42:00.640
We always keep our composure.

42:02.080 --> 42:03.160
Fortune didn't favor me.

42:03.920 --> 42:06.160
So between my husband and family,

42:06.720 --> 42:07.960
I could keep only one.

42:12.280 --> 42:13.480
May luck treat you

42:14.160 --> 42:15.240
better than it did me.

42:25.640 --> 42:26.360
Take care.

42:39.040 --> 42:40.280
You do not know

42:42.280 --> 42:44.320
I am only another soul in Qi,

42:44.720 --> 42:46.280
as powerless as you.

42:59.680 --> 43:00.680
Where is the Chancellor?

43:01.240 --> 43:02.520
The Chancellor left.

43:02.600 --> 43:04.280
He ordered us
to see Your Highness home.

43:06.800 --> 43:08.040
The weather is pleasant today.

43:08.840 --> 43:09.880
I would like a walk.

43:10.520 --> 43:11.320
You may return.

43:18.000 --> 43:21.520
(Shen Residence)

43:31.880 --> 43:32.560
Duan Yunxin?

43:38.480 --> 43:39.680
Why so downhearted?

43:40.160 --> 43:41.360
Do you miss Ms. Meng?

43:46.160 --> 43:48.320
Or is it the Chancellor
you can't let go?

43:50.280 --> 43:51.120
I don't think

43:51.280 --> 43:52.640
we're that close.

43:54.720 --> 43:57.240
We kept our distance
because each of us had a role to play,

43:57.320 --> 43:57.960
minding our own interests,

43:58.040 --> 43:58.960
which made us rivals.

43:59.680 --> 44:00.840
From today on, though,

44:00.920 --> 44:02.480
we are sisters for real.

44:03.040 --> 44:05.000
Come to the Qin Residence
whenever you have time.

44:06.160 --> 44:07.920
Are you not sad in the least?

44:10.120 --> 44:11.440
A noblewoman

44:11.600 --> 44:12.760
has no say in her marriage.

44:13.680 --> 44:14.560
Therefore,

44:14.840 --> 44:16.200
she must protect herself first.

44:19.440 --> 44:20.160
In this world,

44:21.480 --> 44:22.800
the one who should love you most

44:23.040 --> 44:23.880
is you.

44:27.040 --> 44:27.720
Lady Qin,

44:29.120 --> 44:30.080
the carriage is ready.

44:31.080 --> 44:32.360
Don't call me Lady Qin.

44:32.440 --> 44:33.360
Call me Ms. Jieyu.

44:34.200 --> 44:34.800
Yes,

44:35.000 --> 44:35.600
Ms. Jieyu.

44:35.680 --> 44:36.280
Bye.

45:55.880 --> 46:00.920
♪I'm lost for words when you turn away♪

46:02.000 --> 46:08.520
♪The closer our fluttering hearts
draw near, the more they try to hide♪

46:09.880 --> 46:16.320
♪The deeper my thoughts grow
for you at night♪

46:16.480 --> 46:21.720
♪The more afraid I am of losing you♪

46:23.320 --> 46:26.480
♪Your eyes sparkle like the stars
that adorn the night♪

46:26.600 --> 46:29.160
♪Ever so bright, ever so pure♪

46:30.400 --> 46:32.360
♪Reflecting all beneath
the heavens and the earth♪

46:32.440 --> 46:37.200
♪Because of you,
every scene is beautiful♪

46:37.360 --> 46:40.960
♪Though fierce winds rage,
the candle's flame burns warm♪

46:41.120 --> 46:44.320
♪Etching our longing into a vow♪

46:44.400 --> 46:47.760
♪Though parting looms,
no price too great to pay♪

46:47.840 --> 46:51.200
♪In life and death,
our hearts will never stray♪

46:51.480 --> 46:54.680
♪Those simple, ordinary days♪

46:54.760 --> 46:57.720
♪Feel like a dream of mine♪

46:58.480 --> 47:01.720
♪Humble meals a day♪

47:01.800 --> 47:04.440
♪Far away from worldly concerns♪

47:05.560 --> 47:09.280
♪Those memories become clear over time♪

47:09.480 --> 47:12.480
♪Soft and endless like silken threads♪

47:12.640 --> 47:16.080
♪Driven by fate, an undying past♪

47:16.280 --> 47:21.280
♪Unfazed by the ending♪

47:55.560 --> 47:58.760
♪The flower bloomed,
knowing nothing at all♪

47:58.840 --> 48:01.880
♪In splendor, proud and tall♪

48:02.800 --> 48:05.920
♪The flower fell, lashed by the wind♪

48:06.040 --> 48:09.800
♪In a daze,
it felt like lifetimes had thinned♪

48:10.080 --> 48:13.160
♪Petals soaked in rain♪

48:13.280 --> 48:16.600
♪Heartbreak follows again and again♪

48:17.000 --> 48:20.560
♪The flower weeps, burdened by thoughts♪

48:20.640 --> 48:26.360
♪With no one it can be brought♪

48:31.320 --> 48:38.240
♪Wishes struggle through the mire♪

48:38.680 --> 48:45.520
♪Regrets clash in hopeless fire♪

48:46.000 --> 48:53.000
♪Still I hope she'll pick the flower
kissed by dew♪

48:53.320 --> 48:57.360
♪Even if it means this flower♪

48:57.480 --> 49:04.440
♪Will be hers to give to someone new♪

49:15.560 --> 49:18.680
♪Whose eyes
did the flower's heart meet?♪

49:18.760 --> 49:22.000
♪Love and hate held back, discreet♪

49:22.360 --> 49:26.040
♪The flower withers, feelings in decay♪

49:26.160 --> 49:32.720
♪No longer needing to say♪

49:36.800 --> 49:43.720
♪Yet I still long for her in madness♪

49:44.120 --> 49:51.080
♪Unafraid of judgment or sadness♪

49:51.440 --> 49:58.440
♪Remembering the words
she spoke of flowers and skies♪

49:58.800 --> 50:00.480
♪And finding♪

50:00.560 --> 50:07.560
♪They were her gentle heart's reply♪
